zizhan: IOMobileFramebuffer SwapWait answers for real (boot-arg fb_swapwait=1, 2 = Busy instead of NotReady): CoreAnimation
queries after every SwapEnd whether the swap is on the panel / replaced; with zero-copy flipping (pong_zc=2) this is how it learns
when it may draw into a canvas again (docs/plan/2026-10-31-triple-buffer-swapwait.md). Stacks on 0001 and 0009
(MiniIOMobileFramebuffer.cpp); like 0002+ it is reversed and re-applied by every build.

